<div class="prose">
  <h1>About the Relief Portal</h1>
  <p>The Relief Portal connects people who want to help with communities affected by disasters. You can give money, medical supplies, or offer a trained rescue team.</p>
  <h2>How it works</h2>
  <ol>
    <li><strong>Choose a disaster</strong> and how you want to help.</li>
    <li><strong>Give</strong>: pay securely online, or pledge supplies or a team. You immediately get a reference code and a confirmation email.</li>
    <li><strong>Follow your donation</strong>: our coordinators record each step (received, dispatched, delivered) and you are emailed when it changes.</li>
    <li><strong>See the big picture</strong>: the <a href="/dashboard">transparency dashboard</a> shows money raised, money spent and what it was spent on.</li>
  </ol>
  <h2>Our commitments</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Money is counted only after the payment provider confirms it.</li>
    <li>Spending is published, and recorded spending can never exceed money received.</li>
    <li>Donors can choose to stay anonymous on public pages.</li>
    <li>Every administrator action is recorded in an audit log.</li>
  </ul>
  <p><a class="btn" href="/donate">Donate now</a> <a class="btn btn-outline" href="/contact">Contact us</a></p>
</div>

